  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Description:\nJust to clarify this is the older style square menu, not the new flick menu.\nChanging certain settings or changing avatars can result in the position of the menu snapping to under the ground.\nEasiest reproduction steps:\n1. Open the Safety menu \n2. Open performance options\n3. Press Okay.\n4. Your avatar will reload and the menu position will now be in the ground.\nNote: This appears to be a continuation of a previous issue where if you are changing avatars and have the menu open it will alter the menu position. Now it just shoves it into the floor instead of staying up at close to eye level.",
